{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And he shall sprinkle from the blood of the sin-offering.</b> For a burnt-offering He did not require more than נתינה, but for a sin-offering — both הזאה and נתינה. He grasps the nape and sprinkles, and the blood is sprinkled and goes to the altar." "<b>It is a sin-offering.</b> If slaughtered לִשְׁמָהּ — valid; not לִשְׁמָהּ — disqualified (Sifra)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:02.267541857Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}